        "point": "Sequential (IsSeq) property",
        "statement": "Once VTask.stream v n = none for some n, VTask.stream v m = none for all m ≥ n.",
        "note": "This is a structural invariant of the stream, not a default/junk convention."
      },
      {
        "point": "Termination for rationals",
        "statement": "For v : ℚ, there always exists some n such that VTask.stream v n = none.",
        "note": "For non-rational fields the stream may be infinite with no none entries."
      },
